    "detailed_description": "<h1>Check The Social Media Links Section</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/953ec6895ac2b32efc67909d11688cd4.avif?t=1755355647\" width=700 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.poster.avif?t=1755355647\" width=480 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.webm?t=1755355647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.mp4?t=1755355647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Join the Discord server to participate in future playtests. Link found in the social media section. (PC: On the right side - Mobile: Above this description)</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One More Delve is a VR dungeon crawler built around physics-based combat. Team up with up to two other adventurers in online co-op or descend into the dungeons solo.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in realistic melee combat where every slash, parry, and block matters. Feel the weight of your weapon as you dismember your enemies and defend against their attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/97e7bd4419e877b6b96b66eb865f4b70.poster.avif?t=1755355647\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/97e7bd4419e877b6b96b66eb865f4b70.webm?t=1755355647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/97e7bd4419e877b6b96b66eb865f4b70.mp4?t=1755355647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/82af18ceb3b4f9b68ea6a51c9a7b8bce.poster.avif?t=1755355647\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/82af18ceb3b4f9b68ea6a51c9a7b8bce.webm?t=1755355647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/82af18ceb3b4f9b68ea6a51c9a7b8bce.mp4?t=1755355647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a diverse arsenal of one-handed and two-handed swords &amp; axes, bows, shields, and powerful spells as you fight, loot, and explore your way towards the final boss.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/7b010da3bf55d943db37537b768c26c8.poster.avif?t=1755355647\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/7b010da3bf55d943db37537b768c26c8.webm?t=1755355647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/7b010da3bf55d943db37537b768c26c8.mp4?t=1755355647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/dbdcf6edf8599cf183eb43599d86bbbc.poster.avif?t=1755355647\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/dbdcf6edf8599cf183eb43599d86bbbc.webm?t=1755355647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/dbdcf6edf8599cf183eb43599d86bbbc.mp4?t=1755355647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the two-handed axe, become an archer, combine a sword and shield or mix powerful spells into your attacks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/6885bd1f6ad76a51cfaad98d4f73e214.poster.avif?t=1755355647\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/6885bd1f6ad76a51cfaad98d4f73e214.webm?t=1755355647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/6885bd1f6ad76a51cfaad98d4f73e214.mp4?t=1755355647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure is better with friends. Join forces to explore the dungeons and share the spoils, or beat the dungeons as a solo adventurer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/5503c24a7e995c88dc6dd1ae8a863ff1.poster.avif?t=1755355647\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/5503c24a7e995c88dc6dd1ae8a863ff1.webm?t=1755355647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/5503c24a7e995c88dc6dd1ae8a863ff1.mp4?t=1755355647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between dungeon runs, relax in the social hub, interact with other players, and use the materials you've gathered to craft powerful new weapons and armor.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/23e658af51f37d873c59dfbc96c75bd6.poster.avif?t=1755355647\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/23e658af51f37d873c59dfbc96c75bd6.webm?t=1755355647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/23e658af51f37d873c59dfbc96c75bd6.mp4?t=1755355647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>Dungeon Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Run:</strong> Explore immersive dungeons and hunt for rare materials, powerful items, and gold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Mode:</strong> Test your skill and endurance against relentless waves of enemies in an arena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Setup Mode:</strong> Create your own challenge by tailoring the dungeon experience with unique modifiers and settings.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Join the Discord server to participate in future playtests. Link found in the social media section. (PC: On the right side - Mobile: Above this description)</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One More Delve is a VR dungeon crawler built around physics-based combat. Team up with up to two other adventurers in online co-op or descend into the dungeons solo.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in realistic melee combat where every slash, parry, and block matters. Feel the weight of your weapon as you dismember your enemies and defend against their attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/97e7bd4419e877b6b96b66eb865f4b70.poster.avif?t=1755355647\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/97e7bd4419e877b6b96b66eb865f4b70.webm?t=1755355647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/97e7bd4419e877b6b96b66eb865f4b70.mp4?t=1755355647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/82af18ceb3b4f9b68ea6a51c9a7b8bce.poster.avif?t=1755355647\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/82af18ceb3b4f9b68ea6a51c9a7b8bce.webm?t=1755355647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/82af18ceb3b4f9b68ea6a51c9a7b8bce.mp4?t=1755355647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_u